reports/swh_coverage_report.json

# Note: `data/derived/swh_extensions_popularity.csv.gz` (~22 MB gzipped,
# built from the SWH 2026-06-04 export) IS tracked. It can be regenerated via
# `tools/build_swh_ext_year_table.py` + `tools/build_swh_ext_popularity.py`
# but is committed so the CI Pages deploy has the data without an extra
# fetch step. Migrate to Git LFS or a GitHub Releases asset if the repo gets
# too heavy.
